[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 17705.07, "timestamp": "04:55:05", "text": "呃，没有幽灵战斗。没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17721.71, "timestamp": "04:55:21", "text": "仅有的？不，不，不仅如此。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17723.51, "timestamp": "04:55:23", "text": "[音乐]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17725.59, "timestamp": "04:55:25", "text": "你看，你看到了证据。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17730.47, "timestamp": "04:55:30", "text": "正确的？你犯了错。你交叉电磁场，然后"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17733.27, "timestamp": "04:55:33", "text": "这里有个斜杠。你可以划掉点。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17735.59, "timestamp": "04:55:35", "text": "幽灵出现并与幽灵战斗。就在那里"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17738.548, "timestamp": "04:55:38", "text": "会是金还是双胞胎？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17741.27, "timestamp": "04:55:41", "text": "好的。电磁场将它们冻住了。我必须过马路"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17750.11, "timestamp": "04:55:50", "text": "呃，点必须是一条直线，对吧？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17752.628, "timestamp": "04:55:52", "text": "是的。单线。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17754.948, "timestamp": "04:55:54", "text": "鬼魂出现时还有其他什么吗？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 17757.67, "timestamp": "04:55:57", "text": "写作或其他什么？幽灵单线。"}]